    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6s martyres. Of sancto Uite \u00feam martyre. Of \u00feam deorwir\u00f0um martyrum Crispine & Crispiniane. Of sanctus Nicasies reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s martyres. Of sancte Iuuenales reliquion & of his earme. Of sancto Tiburtio \u00feam martyre. Of sancte Uiuianes blode \u00fe\u00e6s martyres. Of \u00feam martyre Eresie. Of sanctus Benignes banon \u00fe\u00e6s martyres. Of sancto Pancratio \u00feam \u00e6\u00f0elan martyre. Of sancto Desiderio \u00feam martyre. Of sancto Iusto \u00feam martyre. And of sancte Ladio. Of sancto Felice \u00feam papan. Of sanctus Cesaries banum \u00fe\u00e6s martyres & of his cla\u00f0on. Of sancte Eustachie \u00feam martyre. Of sanctus Eadwardes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges, \u00fee w\u00e6s unsce\u00f0\u00f0ig acweald. Ac hine si\u00f0\u00f0an Crist wur\u00f0ode mid m\u00e6nigfealdum tacnum. Eac her beo\u00f0 manegra martyra reliquias, \u00fee on Hierusalem for Cristes naman w\u00e6ron gemartyrode. Of sancto Uitale \u00feam unoferswi\u00f0odan martyre, se w\u00e6s swa cucu for Cristes naman on eor\u00f0an Ac he lifa\u00f0 nu mid blisse on \u00feam heofenlican rodere, & eallum, \u00feam\u00fee her on eor\u00f0an mid geleafan to Her is eac sanctus Mauricies to\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan martyres, \u00fee under Maximiane \u00feam casere for Cristes And six\u00f0usend & six & sixtig martyra for\u00f0 mid him \u00ferowedon, \u00fe\u00e6ge ealle \u00feurh his tyhtinge to \u00feam \u00deis sind eac \u00fea reliquias \u00fe\u00e6ra haligra confessorum, \u00fe\u00e6t is Cristes andettera, \u00fe\u00e6ge forsegon \u00feas Erost of sanctus Martines reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s wuldorfullan biscopes, se\u00fee her on life betw",
